---
description: ModusFi website design and content rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Brand wordmark is lowercase `modusfi.`. Official name in prose is ModusFi.
- Primary colours: navy #101D32, turquoise #00B3C6, light background #F5F7FA.
- Position as a technology engineering company with financial services specialisation, not solely a fintech or AI company.
- Keep typography confident, concise and professional; avoid hype and unsupported claims.
- Do not create a Team page. About focuses on philosophy, delivery approach and experience.
- Distinguish founder/team prior experience from ModusFi client deliveries.
- Astro static-first; use client JavaScript only when justified. Ensure keyboard accessibility and reduced-motion support.
- Do not introduce a database, authentication or CMS without a concrete requirement.
